title Cassette: with a Mic boost the CARD stepper shows the card total (level + boost)
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BOOST 1
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
@480x320,640x480 expect text "+15.0 dB"
@320x480 expect text "+15 dB"
shot card-total
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
